OL,5,G0600 James Martin's Islands to
OL,6,G     Highlands
OL,7,     FJames is joined by fellow chef
OL,8,     FTony Singh for a tour of the Isle
OL,9,     Fof Skye and is inspired by the
OL,10,     Famazing local seafood to cook up a
OL,11,     Ftasty dish using monkfish and
OL,12,     Fmussels. The pair then take a boat
OL,13,     Ftrip, during which they spot
OL,14,     Fdozens of dolphins, and James
OL,15,     Fcooks up a fresh lobster and
OL,16,     Flangoustine dish with an added
OL,17,     FScottish twist
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/12
