OL,5,G1100 Nations Championship
OL,6,     FItaly v South Africa (Kick-off
OL,7,     F11.40am). Jill Douglas presents
OL,8,     Fall the action from both teams'
OL,9,     Fopening match of the Northern
OL,10,     FHemsiphere Series, held at Allianz
OL,11,     FStadium in Turin. World champions
OL,12,     FSouth Africa currently sit top of
OL,13,     Fthe Southern Hemisphere table with
OL,14,     Fthree wins from three, while Italy
OL,15,     Fare bottom of the Northern table
OL,16,     Fafter three defeats, but will hope
OL,17,     Fthey can be competitive in front
OL,18,     Fof their own fans. With analysis
OL,19,     Ffrom John Barclay and Greig
OL,20,     FLaidlaw, and commentary by Martin
OL,21,     FGillingham and Tom Shanklin
