OL,6,     FScotland v New Zealand (Kick-off
OL,7,     F2.10pm). Jill Douglas presents all
OL,8,     Fthe action from the match at
OL,9,     FScottish Gas Murrayfield. Scotland
OL,10,     Fimpressed in the Southern
OL,11,     FHemisphere Series, winning two of
OL,12,     Ftheir three matches, but they face
OL,13,     Fa tough test against the All
OL,14,     FBlacks, who have won all of their
OL,15,     Fcontests in the competition so
OL,16,     Ffar. With analysis from John
OL,17,     FBarclay, Greig Laidlaw and Sean
OL,18,     FFitzpatrick, commentary by Miles
OL,19,     FHarrison and Johnnie Beattie, and
OL,20,     Freports from Gabriel Clarke
