OL,9,     FBoth teams won just one match of
OL,10,     Fthree in the Southern Hemisphere
OL,11,     Fseries and will be looking to
OL,12,     Fimpress this evening. The last
OL,13,     Ftime the nations met was in Wales'
OL,14,     F2025 tour of Japan, when the teams
OL,15,     Fwon one match apiece. With
OL,16,     Fanalysis from Dan Biggar and Sam
