OL,5,G0455 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,6,     FOn her morning rounds, Liz takes a
OL,7,     Fmoment to appreciate the life the
OL,8,     Ffamily have built on the farm, but
OL,9,     Ftheir peaceful routine is
OL,10,     Finterrupted when calf Elizabeth
OL,11,     Fdevelops a worrying wheeze.
OL,12,     FFearing pneumonia, the illness
OL,13,     Fthat claimed beloved Cherry last
OL,14,     Fyear, Kelvin and Liz call in vet
OL,15,     FHugo to investigate. Meanwhile,
OL,16,     Fwith the pigs gone, the family
OL,17,     Fbegin transforming the old pig
OL,18,     Ffield into a vegetable patch
